opencv_geometry third-party notices
===================================

opencv_geometry is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The
license text is in the file LICENSE, which is installed beside this file
(share/doc/opencv_geometry/ in an installed prefix).

The C++ shim (libopencv_geometry_shim, built from cpp/) contains private
compatibility code adapted from OpenCV and from code that OpenCV credits.
That code is compiled into the shim library, and GPRinstall also installs
the shim source opencv_geometry_shim.cpp. Which of the adapted code a
given shim library contains depends on the OpenCV version it was built
against; this file covers every build.

Keep this file with every source or binary redistribution of
opencv_geometry. Each notice below is reproduced exactly as it appears in
the upstream file named for it: nothing between a BEGIN line and its END
line has been changed. Upstream files are identified by Git tag and Git
blob identifier.


1. OpenCV (https://github.com/opencv/opencv)
--------------------------------------------

Shipped code adapted from OpenCV:

  cpp/closest_ellipse_compat.hpp
    solveFast and getClosestEllipsePoints, from OpenCV 4.12.0
    modules/imgproc/src/shapedescr.cpp
    (blob f2de38168a70949a5eaadfac718774a5a01b17a7).

  cpp/convex_intersection_compat.hpp
    areaSign, between, parallelInt, intersectLineSegments, inOut, advance,
    addSharedSeg, intersectConvexConvex_ and the post-processing of
    intersectConvexConvex, from OpenCV modules/imgproc/src/geometry.cpp at
    4.11.0 (blob eed9ff3c5ce6c84642ee3ffe3d0b2f6244e8d7b9) and
    4.12.0 (blob c7a52b2f4605c86d95c25d9d7431c81ccc07092e).

  cpp/opencv_geometry_shim.cpp, initialize_float32_compat
    initDelaunay(Rect2f), from OpenCV 4.13.0
    modules/imgproc/src/subdivision2d.cpp
    (blob 78432f456dc537d8b8a7bb30ef07448c11703e56).

